    "long_instructions": "## Plan the Data\r\n\r\nDesign what information one animal should include so your app can display and use it.\r\n\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Decide what your card represents. Each card represents one animal available for adoption.\r\n\r\n2. Rename the properties to match your system. *(Example: `title` → `petName`)*\r\n\r\n3. Add an example value for each property.\r\n\r\n4. Save your sketch to your Backpack.\r\n"
